  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>復古 RPG 字體</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">描述</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">憑藉這款易於閱讀的復古 RPG 風格字體，您的原版遊戲體驗將得到進一步提升。該字體專為&nbsp;<a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 模組包製作，現已公開提供！<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">基於 Daymarius 創作的 <a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.fontriver.com%252ffont%252fretro_gaming%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Retro Gaming</a> 字體。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">該字體採用免費字體許可證授權。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/769/583/retro-rpg-font.PNG\" width=\"1078\" height=\"485\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>截圖</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/769/585/2023-12-05_12.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/769/586/2023-12-05_12.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/769/584/2023-12-05_12.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即獲取伺服器，與朋友們一起遊玩！點擊 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 或下方橫幅，並使用代碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 享受 25% 折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
